name circularglyphs
category Package
revision 68476
shortdesc A circular glyphs alphabet
relocated 1
longdesc Circular Glyphs is a graphic alphabet of substitution based on
longdesc a geometric construction using circles and arcs on a grid. The
longdesc designs are all based on circular arcs, divided into four
longdesc quadrants. It is inspired by Star Trek and used by the Bynar
longdesc and Borg cultures depicted there.
